{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_02_architecture_principle_graph_scope_llm_action", "label": "Principle: graph decides scope, LLM decides action; core domain-agnostic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic scoping is testable and cheap (ADR-0003); domains plug in through adapters so the engine stays domain-agnostic.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_core", "label": "core module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Models, Store interface, ripple engine, resolver interface, ChangeEvents. May import nothing in ripple except core.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_linking", "label": "linking module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rule, LLM and trained linkers behind one Linker interface. May import core, llm.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_storage", "label": "storage module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SQLAlchemy tables, Alembic migrations, Postgres Store (ADR-0016). May import core.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_retrieval", "label": "retrieval module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Validity-aware hybrid search, graph expansion, evidence fetch. May import core, storage.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_llm", "label": "llm module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provider router, schemas, versioned prompts, FakeLLM. May import core.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_agents", "label": "agents module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LangGraph graphs: Conversation, Scout, Curator, Tailor. May import everything above.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_domains", "label": "domains/<name> adapters", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schemas, link types, sources, rules for one domain. May import core, linking.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_module_delivery", "label": "api / mcp_server / notify / worker (delivery)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Delivery layer; may import everything.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_core_domain_agnostic_link_classes", "label": "How core stays domain-agnostic: link classes + Linker/Resolver protocols", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core defines two link classes (depends_on, snapshot_of) and two protocols (Linker, Resolver) it never implements; domain adapters map each link type to a class and the write flow rejects unmapped types before core. Core validates only that link_class is known (ADR-0013).", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_flow_write", "label": "Write flow (ripple.core.intake)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "statement -> change detection (deterministic for structured facts, LLM for prose; ADR-0020) -> new memory/version -> Linker proposes links -> store transaction with ChangeEvent -> post-commit indexing (MemoryIndexer) -> ripple.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_flow_ripple", "label": "Ripple flow (wave by wave)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A memory write is the trigger; engine takes the seed set and emits wave 1 = dependents along depends_on with no status filter and no LLM; they become SUSPECT and commit; Resolver decides keep/update/retire/ask; only updated/retired seed the next wave; keep halts the branch; ask parks in PENDING_USER; repeat until empty wave or depth limit; sweep resumes ripples with no completed_at.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_flow_read", "label": "Read flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "query -> hybrid search over VALID memories -> graph expansion -> evidence -> agent answers with citations.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_flow_scout", "label": "Scout loop", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "schedule or criteria change -> fetch allowed sources -> parse -> dedupe -> write flow -> rank -> notify.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_agent_conversation", "label": "Conversation agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trigger: user message. Reads memory; writes facts via the write flow.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_agent_scout", "label": "Scout agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trigger: daily and criteria change. Fetches allowed sources, writes openings.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_agent_curator", "label": "Curator agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trigger: memory write and nightly sweep (valid_to expiry, weak-link re-check FR-16, resume ripples without completed_at). Runs ripples, asks user, commits.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_agent_tailor", "label": "Tailor agent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trigger: on request. Read only.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_validity_aware_rag", "label": "Validity-aware, graph-expanded, evidence-cited RAG", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "I1: VALID returned; SUSPECT and PENDING_USER only flagged; RETIRED never. Graph expansion 1 hop by default, skipping history depends_on links whose parent is superseded. Key metric: stale retrieval rate.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_open_decisions", "label": "Open architecture decisions (identity/auth, embedding, checkpointer, resume parser)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each needs an ADR before its first import; observability, ORM and job queue decided in ADR-0016..0018.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_security", "label": "Security: untrusted retrieved text, allowed-sources registry, secrets in env", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Retrieved text is untrusted: evidence only in user messages with injection defence in prompts; allowed-sources registry for Scout (ADR-0008); secrets only in env, never logged.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_02_architecture_deployment", "label": "Deployment: Docker Compose on one VPS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "api, worker, postgres(+pgvector), redis (ADR-0017), web; one VPS for the pilot.", "_origin": "semantic"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_02_architecture", "target": "docs_02_architecture_principle_graph_scope_llm_action", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docs_02_architecture_principle_graph_scope_llm_action", "target": "docs_adr_0003_graph_scope_llm_action_decision", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/02-architecture.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"source": "docs_02_architecture", "target": "docs_02_ar